byteDB core features"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"},{"id":9380979947,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc8AAAACLyZk6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2025.2%20Backport%20Required","name":"2025.2 Backport Required","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-03T17:22:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T01:04:12Z","closed_at":"2025-11-06T21:33:25Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-18983](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18983)\n### Description\n\nEarlier, ysql was propagating `pg_txn_start_us` for regular transactions ('kPlain`) alone, which was being used at the tablet wait-queue for prioritizing waiter resumption. This was being done for DMLs alone with the assumption that DDLs don't enter the wait-queue and instead abort active transactions (with object locking disabled)\n\nBut this assumption doesn't seem to hold true with colocated database with index, as the following drop table results in a write query to the index table.\n```\n$CREATE DATABASE db with COLOCATION = true;\n$\\c db;\n$CREATE TABLE test (k INT, v INT, PRIMARY KEY (k ASC));\n$CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_1 ON test (v ASC);\n$DROP INDEX idx_1;\n```\n\nand when there are active DML transactions operating at the table, the drop DDL enters the wait-queue, which leads to the below DFATAL\n```\n[ts-1] F1101 11:02:59.304080 661742 wait_queue.cc:268] TxnId: 6557ecea-23bc-44b9-8d55-6c264ae0b958, ReqId: 612 Expected non-zero txn_start_us\n```\n\nFix this by propagating the pg txn start time from ysql to docdb, and initializes YBTransaction with the same so that the write rpc picks this up, and the wait-queue honors the waiter resumption logic.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-18983]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18983?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29215/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}